=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Note: }** In order to start this quest, you must first be on the {M:Crossroads of Time|Crossroads of Time|Crossroads of Time} Mission (obtained after completing {M:A Nation on the Brink|A Nation on the Brink|A Nation on the Brink}).
* You must zone and wait one game day after completing {q:In a Haze of Glory|In a Haze of Glory|In a Haze of Glory} in order to start this quest.
* Speak to {n:Rholont} (E-7) in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} for a cutscene.
* Gather the following three {@k} {p:key items|Category:Key Items}:
** {@k} {k:Ronfaure maple syrup}: obtained randomly by {p:logging|Logging} in {z:East Ronfaure (S)}.
*** The next quest also requires logging, therefore it's recommended to purchase multiple {i:Hatchets|Hatchet|1021}.
** {@k} {k:Long-life biscuits}: obtained by examining the **Tree Hollow** directly behind Rholont.
** {@k} {k:Flask of Kingdom water}: obtained by examining the **Well** east of Rholont.
* Speak to Rholont to receive the {@k} {k:Biscuit a la Rholont}.
* Go to {z:Jugner Forest (S)} and examine the **Felled Trees** at western (G-7). Use the Campaign warp.
** Fastest way to get here is to {s:Recall-Jugner}; if that's not available, run North then NW from the {z:Jugner Forest (S)} {p:Survival Guide} warp.
* Go to {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} (the {p:Campaign} warp is closer than the {p:Survival Guide} to your first destination) and examine two **Toppled Cressets** in the correct order:
** First, examine the **Toppled Cresset** at (I-8) for a short cutscene leading you west.
** Next, examine the second **Toppled Cresset** at (F-9)/(F-8) for another short cutscene leading you south.
* Examine the **Underbrush** at (F-13) for a third cutscene. Examine it again to spawn **Madthrasher Zradbodd**.
** Madthrasher Zradbodd is an Orc BLM who has a large amount of Fastcast. He likes to spam Tier IV elemental and tier III elemental -ga spells, as well as Sleepga and Dispellga.
** Having a Blue Mage to stun the area of effect spells is very handy if you're below i119.
* After defeating Madthrasher Zradbodd, check the **Underbrush** again for a message telling you to go to Pashhow Marshlands (S).
** You will have to defeat the NM again if you zone without getting this message!
* Go to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} at (G-6) and examine the **Shimmering Pondweed** for a cutscene that completes the quest.
** The spot you are looking for within (G-6) will be in the northwest corner of the grid.
*** Using the Campaign teleport will most likely be your fastest way here.
*** The next closest method is teleporting to the Survival Guide in {z:Rolanberry Fields (S)}, which will put you right at the top zone line for Pashhow Marshlands (S).

